Design references
-----------------
Layout patterns on the home page and header were informed by the public
America.gov service and by the U.S. Web Design System (USWDS) documentation.
Seva Saathi re-implements those patterns in original React/Tailwind code.
See docs/DESIGN-SOURCES.md for licences and what was not copied.

Noto Sans font files are loaded from Google Fonts under the SIL Open Font
License 1.1. Lucide icons are used under the ISC licence.

